{
  "sn46.54:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 46.54 ",
  "sn46.54:0.2": "6. Sākacchavagga ",
  "sn46.54:0.3": "Mettāsahagatasutta ",
  "sn46.54:1.1": "Ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā koliyesu viharati haliddavasanaṁ nāma koliyānaṁ nigamo. ",
  "sn46.54:1.2": "Atha kho sambahulā bhikkhū pubbaṇhasamayaṁ nivāsetvā pattacīvaramādāya haliddavasanaṁ piṇḍāya pavisiṁsu. ",
  "sn46.54:1.3": "Atha kho tesaṁ bhikkhūnaṁ etadahosi: ",
  "sn46.54:1.4": "“atippago kho tāva haliddavasane piṇḍāya carituṁ. ",
  "sn46.54:1.5": "Yannūna mayaṁ yena aññatitthiyānaṁ paribbājakānaṁ ārāmo tenupasaṅkameyyāmā”ti. ",
  "sn46.54:2.1": "Atha kho te bhikkhū yena aññatitthiyānaṁ paribbājakānaṁ ārāmo tenupasaṅkamiṁsu; upasaṅkamitvā tehi aññatitthiyehi paribbājakehi saddhiṁ sammodiṁsu. ",
  "sn46.54:2.2": "Sammodanīyaṁ kathaṁ sāraṇīyaṁ vītisāretvā ekamantaṁ nisīdiṁsu. Ekamantaṁ nisinne kho te bhikkhū aññatitthiyā paribbājakā etadavocuṁ: ",
  "sn46.54:3.1": "“Samaṇo, āvuso, gotamo sāvakānaṁ evaṁ dhammaṁ deseti: ",
  "sn46.54:3.2": "‘etha tumhe, bhikkhave, pañca nīvaraṇe pahāya cetaso upakkilese paññāya dubbalīkaraṇe mettāsahagatena cetasā ekaṁ disaṁ pharitvā viharatha, tathā dutiyaṁ, tathā tatiyaṁ, tathā catutthaṁ; iti uddhamadho tiriyaṁ sabbadhi sabbattatāya sabbāvantaṁ lokaṁ mettāsahagatena cetasā vipulena mahaggatena appamāṇena averena abyāpajjena pharitvā viharatha. ",
  "sn46.54:3.